# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and in working trees.
#
# Load-bearing, not cosmetic. This tree is cloned by a Cursor agent onto a
# self-hosted worker whose git configuration we do not control. Checked out with
# CRLF, an agent that rewrites a file with LF produces a diff with mixed endings,
# and the recorded patch no longer reapplies to a fresh export — which breaks
# replay, the recorded-run test fixture, and the demo's artifact walk.
* text=auto eol=lf
